What are you doing for Christmas? 🎄🇫🇷 Say it in French

• chez mes grands-parents = at my grandparents'
• je reste = I stay
• un cadeau = a gift
• je prends le train = I take the train
• Tu fais quoi ? = What are you doing?

💬 Your turn: Pour Noël, je vais ___ !

